**import.hpp declares the gamepad controller-engine engine-import interface and packed aim-assist memory layout.**

## Interface

`dvar_t = game::dvar_s`, `usercmd_s = game::usercmd_t`; constants `DVAR_NONE`, `DVAR_ARCHIVE`, `DVAR_ROM`, `DVAR_CHEAT`, `K_ENTER`, `K_ESCAPE`, `K_UPARROW`, `K_DOWNARROW`, `K_LEFTARROW`, `K_RIGHTARROW` alias game dvar flags/key codes.

`Dvar_FindVar(const char*) noexcept -> dvar_t*`; `Dvar_RegisterBool`, `Dvar_RegisterFloat`, `Dvar_RegisterInt`, `Dvar_RegisterString -> dvar_t*`; `Dvar_SetBool`, `Dvar_SetInt`, `Dvar_SetString -> void`; `Sys_Milliseconds() noexcept -> int`; `menu_or_console_active() noexcept -> bool`; `emit_key(int, bool, unsigned) noexcept -> void`.

## Packed Layout

`AimScreenTarget` stores `entityNum`, 2D `clipMins`/`clipMaxs`, 3D `position`/`velocity`, `distSqr`, and `crosshairDistSqr`.

`AimAssistGlobals` stores initialization, slowdown/lock-on regions, `playerVelocity`, `viewAxis`, `adsLerp`, 64 `screenTargets`, and `screenTargetCount`; `#pragma pack(1)` fixes offsets `screenTargets == 0xFC`, `screenTargetCount == 0xDFC`, `sizeof == 0xE34`.

`aim_globals(int) noexcept -> AimAssistGlobals&`; `view_pitch() noexcept -> float&`; `view_yaw() noexcept -> float&`; `frame_seconds() noexcept -> float`.